From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jhansi kotipalli <jkotipal@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:50:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] binder: guard SELinux label header

The no-SELinux distro does not stage libselinux headers.  The service
manager already compiles its SELinux code conditionally, so include the
label header under the same conditional.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [platform-specific no-SELinux build]
Signed-off-by: jkotipal <jkotipal@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 cmds/servicemanager/service_manager.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/cmds/servicemanager/service_manager.c b/cmds/servicemanager/service_manager.c
--- a/cmds/servicemanager/service_manager.c
+++ b/cmds/servicemanager/service_manager.c
@@ -11,1 +11,3 @@
+#ifdef SELINUX_IS_ENABLE
 #include <selinux/label.h>
+#endif
